  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Refugee Resettlement Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will facilitate the resettlement of refugees in Asia to Japan, as such providing a durable solution for refugees, within the objective of improving the protection and sustainable integration of refugees and migration management of the Government of Japan. With provision of pre-departure assistances, such as pre-migration health activities, pre-departure orientation and language sessions, and facilitation of the travel document processing, and of movement management to Japan, the project will support safe and dignified migration and integration to new communities in Japan.</narrative>
  </description>
